mation you'll  see here  bill gates created the virus that a  million mentions 5g causes covid at  about a half a million  we still see things around  hydroxychloroquine these things  tend to spin and spin and spin since the  start of the pandemic the company has  pulled in  over three billion stories related to  misleading and false narratives around  covid  and the vaccine oftentimes you can see  within the hashtags  of what's being shared a more deliberate  effort to spread  misinformation and you can sometimes  trace that back to  a particular group or a set of actors  that are doing that a government census  recently found that 36 percent  don't trust the vaccine almost 29 don't  trust the government  do those numbers correlate with what  you're seeing absolutely  but our job is to really identify those  things that we see emerging online and  put it in the hands of the people that  are going to be able to make decisions  with it  in the hands of social media platforms  like twitter and youtube  misinformation has dire public health  consequences  dr garth graham heads a new youtube  partnership with  well-trusted health organizations like  the american public health association  and mayo clinic to counter myths with  fact-based medical videos so we give  them the science  but in the culturally specific and  culturally appropriate way  video allows you to deliver digestible  information  in the right format and reach people in  the right way your body's not making  the whole virus you can't get the  infection from the vaccine  what vulnerability did covet expose in  terms of  our ability to get information to the  consumer what covid  showed was that we needed to do a better  job  of at least first empowering individuals  with information immediately  as we develop the science and  disseminate the science we have to be  able to  give people that information in a timely  manner we need to reach people where  they are where their minds are at where  their hearts 